cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "pleio-hpo: offline HPO code extraction from clinical free text"
abstract: >-
  An offline, CPU-only pipeline that maps free-text clinical descriptions to
  Human Phenotype Ontology (HPO) codes via lexical matching, biomedical
  sentence embeddings (SapBERT), and a PubMedBERT cross-encoder validator.
authors:
  - name: "Pleio Labs"
type: software
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-06-08
url: "https://github.com/Pleio-Labs/pleio-hpo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Pleio-Labs/pleio-hpo"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - HPO
  - phenotype
  - clinical-NLP
  - biomedical
  - named-entity-recognition
